# Files Git leaves out when this folder is uploaded to GitHub. They stay on your computer.
# To see what will be uploaded before you commit:  git status
# To put something on GitHub after all, delete its line here.

# Only README.md, .gitignore, 06_ (the Python core) and the video/ folder of 11_ (the intro video
# and the files that made it) are public. Not public: the competition proposal, folders 01–05,
# the team's own notes, and the rest of 11_ (the demo site's code and its Cloudflare Worker).
/00_*.docx
/00_先讀我.md
/01_*/
/02_*/
/03_*/
/04_*/
/05_*/
/07_*.md
/09_*.md
/10_*.md
/11_示範網站_Idea2Alpha/*
!/11_示範網站_Idea2Alpha/video/
/給同學_*.md

# Office files and archives anywhere in the folder, so one added later stays off GitHub too
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.odt
*.ods
*.odp
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# Keys and passwords. None are in this folder now; these lines keep any you add later off GitHub.
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

# Data: the factor panel and other files the programs write (output/), FinMind downloads (cache/).
# FinMind data is not redistributed; everyone downloads their own with their own token.
**/output/*
cache/
*.parquet

# Files the video rebuild creates (screen frames, trimmed voice, the new video)
/11_示範網站_Idea2Alpha/video/source/capture/
/11_示範網站_Idea2Alpha/video/source/voice/
/11_示範網站_Idea2Alpha/video/source/out/

# Python, Node and editor leftovers
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
node_modules/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
*.tmp

# Windows and Office temporary files (~$ files appear while a Word or Excel file is open)
~$*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
